Package: actmon-agent
Version: 1.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: procps, curl | wget
Maintainer: ActMon <support@actmon.local>
Description: ActMon Host Monitoring Agent
 Lightweight agent that collects host CPU and memory metrics and pushes them
 to the ActMon monitoring platform. Runs as a systemd service.
 The installer accepts ACTMON_ACCESS_TOKEN / ACTMON_URL from the environment
 to configure and start the service in one step.
